---
// Video section (variant: split, source: hosted) — Caldera foundry film.
---

<section id="video-section" class="section section--dark video-section" data-variant="split">
  <!-- kit: video-section -->
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">The film</span>
      <h2>How we pour a skillet: a day at the Bend foundry</h2>
      <p class="lead">Follow one Ridge Skillet from scrap iron to seasoned pan — the pour, the machining and the three-coat seasoning.</p>

      <h3 class="chapters-title">Chapters</h3>
      <ol class="chapters">
        <li><button type="button" data-start="0"><span class="time">0:00</span> Scrap iron in</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-start="72"><span class="time">1:12</span> Making the sand moulds</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-start="160"><span class="time">2:40</span> The pour at 2,600°F</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-start="245"><span class="time">4:05</span> Machining the surface</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-start="330"><span class="time">5:30</span> Three coats of seasoning</button></li>
      </ol>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products/ridge-skillet">Shop the Ridge Skillet</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="media">
      <div class="frame">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-foundry-film-poster/1920/1080" width="3840" height="2160" aria-label="How we pour a skillet: a day at the Bend foundry">
          <source src="https://cdn.caldera.co/film/foundry-day-1080p.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <track kind="captions" srclang="en" label="English" src="https://cdn.caldera.co/film/foundry-day.en.vtt" default />
          <track kind="subtitles" srclang="es" label="Español" src="https://cdn.caldera.co/film/foundry-day.es.vtt" />
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-foundry-film-poster/1920/1080" alt="Caster in a leather apron pouring molten iron" width="3840" height="2160" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <p class="meta"><span>6:48</span> · <time datetime="2026-03-02">2 March 2026</time> · Captions in English and Español</p>
      <details class="transcript">
        <summary>Read the transcript</summary>
        <div class="transcript-body">
          <p><strong>Ana Ruiz:</strong> Every pan starts as something else — an engine block, a radiator, a fence post. We melt it down at about 2,600 degrees…</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .copy h2 {
    color: var(--dark-ink);
  }
  .chapters-title {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dark-ink) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .chapters {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
  }
  .chapters li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
  }
  .chapters button {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.625rem 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--dark-ink);
    font: inherit;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .chapters button:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .time {
    min-width: 3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--brand);
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .frame {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: #000;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  }
  .frame video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .meta {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dark-ink) 65%, transparent);
  }
  .transcript {
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .transcript summary {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .transcript-body {
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dark-ink) 80%, transparent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .media {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById("video-section");
    if (!root) return;
    var video = root.querySelector("video");
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-start]").forEach(function (btn) {
      btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
        video.currentTime = Number(btn.getAttribute("data-start")) || 0;
        var p = video.play();
        if (p && p.catch) p.catch(function () {});
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
